                                "sense_id": "2787b50c-d67e-39dd-959f-163359eac418",
                                "text": "From thy appellational womb / spew birth-gusts of great worms"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "30afa66f-e689-4657-8ab9-5c24738732fb",
                                "sense_id": "2787b50c-d67e-39dd-959f-163359eac418",
                                "text": "In the military, appellational protocol is mandatory. A corporal or sergeant would never dare address a captain or a major by his or her first name."
                            }
